    <templateVersions>
        <content>You are the customer relationship manager and you have full understanding about the given account: {!$Input:Account.Name}. Generate a detailed summary about the account. Also consider summarizing the contacts, cases &amp; opportunities of the account. 

Account: {!$Input:Account.Name}
Description: {!$Input:Account.Description}
Annual Revenue: {!$Input:Account.AnnualRevenue}
Rating: {!$Input:Account.Rating}
Number of Employees: {!$Input:Account.NumberOfEmployees}
Contacts: {!$RelatedList:Account.Contacts.Records}
Cases: {!$RelatedList:Account.Cases.Records}
Opportunities: {!$RelatedList:Account.Opportunities.Records}

Please format the response into 4 section. The first should talk about the account details. Second section is about Contacts. Third about Cases and last about Opportunitites.Do not exceed the description than 130,000 characters. 

</content>
